{"id":"e_videmment","lemma":"évidemment","pos":"adv","rank":1030,"glosses":["of course, evidently, obviously"],"ipa":"/e.vi.da.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/06/Fr-%C3%A9videmment.ogg/Fr-%C3%A9videmment.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Évidemment, vous pouvez rester.","en":"Of course you can stay.","words":[null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to stay"}]},{"text":"Évidemment, il a raison.","en":"Of course, he is right.","words":[null,{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"reason"}]},{"text":"Ceci est évidemment faux.","en":"This is obviously fake.","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"false"}]},{"text":"Évidemment, tu as raison.","en":"Of course, you're correct.","words":[null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"reason"}]},{"text":"C'était une blague, évidemment.","en":"That was a joke, of course.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"joke"},null]}]}